msgid "Discard"
msgstr "Wegsmieten"

#. +> trunk stable
#: scheduler.cpp:431
msgctxt "@option"
msgid "Go Back to Folder Selection"
msgstr "Torüch na de Ornerköör"

#. +> trunk stable
#: scheduler.cpp:435
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The invitation \"%1\" was not saved to your calendar but you are still listed "
"as an attendee for that appointment.\n"
"If you mistakenly accepted the invitation or do not plan to attend, please "
"notify the organizer %2 and ask them to remove you from the attendee list."
msgstr ""
"De Inladen \"%1\" wöör nich na Dien Kalenner sekert, Du büst man noch jümmers "
"as Deelnehmer för dissen Termin opföhrt.\n"
"Hest Du de Inladen ut Versehn annahmen oder wullt Du nich deelnehmen, segg "
"bitte den Utrichter %2 Bescheed, dat he Di ut de Deelnehmerlist rutnehmen "
"deit."

#. +> trunk stable
#: scheduler.cpp:451
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Unable to save %1 \"%2\"."
msgstr "%1 \"%2\" lett sik nich sekern."

#. +> trunk stable
#: scheduler.cpp:546
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The event or task could not be removed from your calendar. Maybe it has "
"already been deleted or is not owned by you. Or it might belong to a "
"read-only or disabled calendar."
msgstr ""
"De Begeefnis- oder Opgaavindrag lett sik nich ut Dien Kalenner wegmaken. "
"Villicht hett Een em al wegmaakt, oder villicht büst Du nich de Eegner. "
"Villicht höört he ok en bloots-leesbor oder utmaakt Kalenner to."

#. +> trunk stable
#: scheduler.cpp:583
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The event or task to be canceled could not be removed from your calendar. "
"Maybe it has already been deleted or is not owned by you. Or it might belong "
"to a read-only or disabled calendar."
msgstr ""
"De Begeefnis- oder Opgaavindrag, den Du övergahn wullt, lett sik nich ut Dien "
"Kalenner wegmaken. Villicht hett Een em al wegmaakt, oder villicht büst Du "
"nich de Eegner. Villicht höört he ok en bloots-leesbor oder utmaakt Kalenner "
"to."

